Hey everyone,

I'm inviting you all to The Head-Last Project. I am interested in
gathering people from many different backgrounds to contribute. Here
is the Yahoo! Group description:

The purpose of this group is to develop an interesting language that
consistently applies head-last (or left-branching) grammar and
syntax. This project will be open-source, although consensus will
generally determine the path(s) of development (however, there will
probably be no voting/polls). Membership is open to anyone who wishes
to join - the more, the merrier!

To join, just go to http://groups.yahoo.com/group/headlast and click
on "Join This Group!" Hope to see you there soon!

(Apologies if this is considered spam - that was not my intention!)

- Rob


